<title>USA: Casino Data names chief executive.</title>
<headline>Casino Data names chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino Data Systems said on Tuesday it named Daniel Copp as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Copp replaces Chairman Steven Weiss who has been chief executive since April 1996. Copp has been an outside member of the board of directors since June 1996.</p>
<p>Copp previously served as chief financial officer of Circus Circus Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>Casino Data designs, makes and distributes computer based technology for the gaming industry.</p>
